<title>HUNGARY: Hungarian T-bill av. yields seen lower at auctions.</title>
<headline>Hungarian T-bill av. yields seen lower at auctions.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian dealers were virtually unanimous in saying that average discount treasury bill yields will move lower at this week's auctions.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) will hold a one-month T-bill auction on Tuesday, a three-month auction on Wednesday, a six-month auction on Thursday and a 12-month auction on Friday.</p>
<p>			 1-mo	 3-mo	6-mo     12-mo</p>
